<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.8.6">
<l>kīḻulaki lacurarkaḷaik kiḻaṅkiruntu kiḷarāmē</l>
<l>yāḻiviṭut tavaruṭaiya karuvaḻitta vaḻippaṉūr</l>
<l>tāḻaimaṭa lūṭuriñcit tavaḷavaṇṇap poṭiyaṇintu</l>
<l>yāḻiṉicai vaṇṭiṉaṅka ḷāḷamvaikku maraṅkamē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The city of the destroyer who,</l>
<l rend="indent">having dispatched [his] discus,</l>
<l rend="indent">exterminated the demons in the underworld </l>
<l rend="indent">[even right down to] their unborn,</l>
<l rend="indent">not even being able to arise,</l>
<l>is Araṅkam where groups of bees, adorned with white pollen,</l>
<l rend="indent">rubbing between the leaves of the screw-pine,</l>
<l rend="indent"> create a tune [like] the sweet sound of the Yāḻ</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
